    <source>https://www.dbnl.org/tekst/duys001oude02_01/duys001oude02_01_0229.php
Melody and one verse manually transcribed from Florimond van Duyse, Het oude Nederlandsche lied, vol. 2, 1905, pp. 1833–1834, variant V citing G. J. Boekenoogen’s 1896 collection. Historical words “’k Zag” and final “na” retained. No modern commercial arrangement reused.</source>
